{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119639","id":3725834505,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7eE7kJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119639","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119639.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119639.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119639","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119639/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119639/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119639/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c6987624efe17ffd78dfe9e8b76eaa4854704ca2","number":119639,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Disable ubershaders on problematic Adreno compiler versions.","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #116990\r\n\r\nThe PR adds a path to detect problematic Adreno drivers where the compiler crashes from ubershaders with too many constant literals. When detected, ubershaders are disabled to avoid the issue, at the cost of pipeline compilation stutters.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe crashing compiler version appears to be `EV031.32.02.01`. I made it enable the workaround for all `EV031.32.02.XX` versions, but **we don't know the exact affected range yet**. The crash also can happen in other Adreno GPUs, the reported issue mentions Adreno 650 but I managed to replicate it on Adreno 630 by flashing a custom ROM.\r\n\r\nThe compiler version is checked through `driverInfo` in `VkPhysicalDeviceDriverProperties`, which ended up unfortunately being most of the code in this PR. Since this struct requires the `VK_KHR_driver_properties` device extension, it's only possible to query it during device creation (I also did not want to call `vkEnumerateDeviceExtensionProperties` like 4 times.)\r\n\r\nSo, I ended up moving out the workarounds struct to `RenderingDeviceCommons` and have Vulkan fill it during device creation. The previous \"compute after draw\" workaround should still work fine this way.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","